window.products.push({"id":635041,"name":"Poly and Bark Padget Arm Chair in Yellow (Set of 2)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JN8bGiSsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You don't have to be an artist to know that a minimalist design and perfect ergonomic shape combine to make the Replica Eames Style Molded Plastic Eiffel Armchair (DAR) a triumph of contemporary style. In a year that birthed Samuel L. Jackson, Olivia Newton-John and Steven Tyler, this chair is still the most stylish and best looking of the bunch.  Immediately recognizable for its polished chrome steel Eiffel tower frame, the original DAR Armchair was one of the first plastic chairs to be mass produced. Its popularity is well deserved, with a strong yet flexible polypropylene seat, perfectly contoured for maximum comfort. The profile is striking, combining bright colors with a silver frame to create a look that is classic yet contemporary in any setting. Almost 60 years on, our replica continues to provide the same example of functionality and form.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JN8bGiSsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"POLY & BARK","source_asin":"B01CVJ4BSE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-635041","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CVJ4BSE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CVJ4BSE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
