window.products.push({"id":635125,"name":"AYMY Sherpa Fleece 48x72 inch Twin Size Weighted Blanket for Adults Cozy Plush Bed Blanket 15lbs Heavy Blankets with Premium Glass Beads on Twin/Full ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516hWx15CFL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"It is the gateway to peace and comfort.Our Sherpa fleece weighted blanket is super skin-friendly.Silky velvety fleece on one side and soft breathable microfiber material on the other .Snuggle into it and feel the warmth of gentle embrace, so as to help you relax and enjoy a peaceful sleep. The weight is perfect and spread out great.Each small quilt pocket is filled with environmentally friendly nano-glass beads that light pressure dispersed evenly all over, like someone giving you a great big bear hug and doesn’t stop.It contours with any body shape and sleeping position to achieve the desired compression comfort. Choose correct weight and size. It's a twin size weighted blanket black marble that measures 48 x 72 inches, and it weighs 15 pounds. Weight is created with premium glass beads and extra layers of high quality material.Regarding the choice of blanket weight.It is recommended to choose approximately 10 percent of your body weight.It may take 2 to 7 days to get used to the weight.You’ll enjoy deep pressure for a good night’s sleep with a balance of thickness blanket. Versatile and Eaasy cleaning. Perfect for either the sofa or on a bed.Any other place you need, even for outdoor activities. Spot clean or commercial machine wash if contaminated. It is recommended to hang to dry or tumble dry in low heat if necessary. Definitely a great gift for anyone or yourself.Buying gifts for those we love should be a heartwarming experience. Weighted blanket is the best sleep gift for your family or friends to express love and care .If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us ,we'll provide fast, friendly service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516hWx15CFL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AYMY","source_asin":"B0BGRDW9DQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-635125","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGRDW9DQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGRDW9DQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
