window.products.push({"id":635199,"name":"HAUSHOF Kitchen Knife Set, 6-Piece Colorful Knives Set with Sheath for Kitchen, Non-Stick Coated Stainless Steel Blades for Slicing, Dicing&Cutting, G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pXpudahcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Professional All-In-One Knife Set] The all-in-one kitchen knife set includes an 8\" chef Knife, an 8\" bread knife, an 8\" Slicing Knife, a 7\" Santoku Knife, a 6-1/2\" Sandwich Knife, a 3-1/2\" Paring Knife, 6 Sheath Covers. This professional multi-functions kitchen knife set can easily handle your daily kitchen tasks of chopping, slicing, mincing, and dicing fruits, vegetables, and other cooking work. [Quality Stainless Steel Blades] This Kitchen knife set is forged from durable stainless steel with non-stick coating, which ensures resists stains and corrosion. The blade edge reached 27-40 degrees per side. These sharp, high-quality professional blades have noticeably stronger cutting surfaces to achieve ultra-thin slicing and maximum elasticity. [Non-Stick & Anti-Rust Color Coating] The durable non-stick coating blades of colored kitchen knives make it a breeze to slice and clean. The colored coating helps to differentiate the utility of each knife, thus keeping your food fresher during food preparation and creating more delicious dishes. Note: Colorful knives are not toys, please keep out of reach of children! [Ergonomic Handle] The handle of each knife is made from PP material. The ergonomic handle minimizes wrist tension while providing a safe and comfortable grip, improving work efficiency. It is very suitable for those who love cooking. [Perfect as Gift] The kitchen knife set comes in a high-quality colored utility gift box, making it the perfect gift for your family, lovers, or friends who enjoy cooking, such as Mother's Day, Father's Day, Thanksgiving Day, Black Friday, Christmas day, New Year, Easter Day, Halloween, birthday, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pXpudahcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HAUSHOF","source_asin":"B0BGHK5FMM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-635199","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGHK5FMM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGHK5FMM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
