window.products.push({"id":635342,"name":"Humidifiers For Bedroom Ultrasonic Cool Mist Humidifier Mini Humidifier With Auto Off Function Colorful Night Light Humidifiers For Home Office 2L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hyOT8o1rL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【Exquisite design and easy to clean 】- The small humidifiers for bedroom with removable cover instead of straight mist. The spray port of the cool mist humidifiers is enlarged, and the large amount of mist drives away the dryness. the mist is uniform and not easy to drip, and the humidification effect is good.The room humidifier is easy to use ,the convenient top-fill of the plant humidifier design lets you easily clean and refills the humidifier whenever you need . 【Super quiet and multipurpose】- The humidifiers for bedroom adopted ultrasonic technology, this aroma diffuser is extremely quiet when working. The humidifiers for large room is discernibly silent produces less than 30 dB of noise,perfect for your baby and a disturbance-free sleep at night . The humidifiers for home Intimate mute design, atomization humidification is silent. 【Ultrasonic humidifier】- The humidifiers use ultrasonic technology to quiet release water mist into the air to help temporarily relieve ,and dry skin caused by dry air .The ultrasonic humidifiers can effectively increase the indoor temperature, moisturize dry air, make the air fresher.The mini humidifier for bedroom protect the health of you and your family.The air humidifier suitable for bedroom ,living room,office,spa or Yoga. 【Waterless auto-off function】- When water runs out the night light the will continue to shine and the light will notify you that more water should be added. humidifiers for bedroom large room with 2L large capacity, continuous humidification for 10 hours, to avoid the trouble of adding water, and with the function of automatic power off when water is lacking.The portable humidifiers will automatically stop running when water is lacking to prevent it from drying out. 【7 LED colors】-The humidifiers for bedroom with 7 smoothing LED light,use essential oil diffuser as a night light to add romantic ambience.7 color LED lights can be cycled through.Gently press the button to experience a flowing rainbow of colors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hyOT8o1rL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Small and Beauty","source_asin":"B09PG7N4B7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-635342","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PG7N4B7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PG7N4B7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
