window.products.push({"id":635568,"name":"Ameritex Sofa Cover, Reversible Quilted Furniture Protector, Ideal Sofa Slipcovers for Pets & Children, Water Resistant, Will Keep Your Couch Stain, D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41A3oT7Rz5L._AC_.jpg","description":"No matter what type of upholstery fabric covers your sofa, pets, children and daily use may damage it. Dirt, dust and debris cling to any upholstery and typically will not budge until you clean them away. After years of accumulating dirt, your sofa will look dingy, stained and dull. By using the right protection, you can keep your sofa looking good for years to come Our reversible quilted furniture cover offers a comfortable layer of protection with 2 great looks! They rest directly on top of your existing furniture to shield it from spills, stains and those special messes only kids and pets can make Since you don't have to wrap them over furniture, they are just as easy to take off when you want to show off the original look of your sofa. Tired of the color? Just flip it over for a new shade! Quilted construction adds a layer of extra comfort. Soil and snag-resistant covers are also easy machine care What makes us the best choice? Quick set up, simply place over your furniture Machine washable Reversible design to match your decor Water resistant Durable quilted texture Fit most types of furniture Product features: Upholstery Material: Polyester Pieces Included: One Piece Product Care: Machine washable","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41A3oT7Rz5L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ameritex","source_asin":"B07CW8334T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-635568","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CW8334T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CW8334T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
