window.products.push({"id":635678,"name":"SULTANA ISTANBUL - 100% Linen Turkish Towel (39 x 70) Peshtemal + Evil Eye Bracelet - Wash Resistant - Do not Compare with Linen and Cotton Mixed Towe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pDuwS84tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We know that you are bored with old-fashioned, space-occupying, fragrant towels in the bathroom, beach, Turkish bath, sauna or anywhere. Sultana Istanbul invites you to try its products. It meets the demands of our esteemed customers with its extra absorbency, not taking up space, not smelling and drying at least as much as a towel. With its superior absorbent feature, the linen towel series brings Sultana Istanbul to the fore compared to other peshtemals. Below you can see the benefits of lines towel. Here are just a few of the benefits of linen, • It is environmentally friendly. Fewer chemicals and less water are needed to make it grow. • It is 30% stronger than cotton. It far outlasts cotton in durability. • It is much more absorbent than cotton. • It is breathable. It dries far more quickly than cotton, thus reducing that “mildewy” smell you get with cotton towels. • It is less bulky. When travelling it takes up much less space in your luggage","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pDuwS84tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SULTANA ISTANBUL","source_asin":"B07TJYRSN1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-635678","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TJYRSN1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TJYRSN1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":635679,"name":"Ceramic Christmas Tree, 10-15 Inches Decorative Christmas Tree with LED Lights Hand Painted Holiday Decorations with Multicolored Bulbs Elegant Design","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71I3uK4ENvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do you like your traditional Ceramic Christmas trees which bring back childhood memories of your grandparents' home? Here’s a twist on the traditional Christmas ceramic tree with a Christmas version. You don't have to wait until December to get behind the trend. Features: The amazing festive Christmas tree decor comes in a wonderful color that was created through electroplating, which gives a reflective look. This retro ceramic tree will remind you of the perfect holidays you used to have as a child.   Enjoy the festive colors with this lovely hand painted pre-lit Christmas centerpiece which comes with 50 multicolored bulbs and a 7-point star topper, guaranteed to impress everyone! All you must do is input 3 AA batteries at the base and enjoy the light effects! Why choose our Ceramic Christmas trees ? Ours has two modern upgrades: 1.Instead of traditional light bulbs, we use LED lights that are brighter and safer. LED lights are cold to the touch no matter how long they remain on, safety risks such as burns and fires are not a concern. In addition LED lights are 90% more energy-efficient than incandescent bulbs.  2.Cordless design enables you to put it anywhere without the hassle of tangling cords. Please do remember to turn off the light manually to avoid it eating up your batteries. If the lights go dim, please replace the batteries. Looking for a way of adding a touch of Christmas spirit to your home this holiday season? Would you like to impress your loved ones with a lovely table centerpiece on Christmas dinner? This gorgeous ceramic tree is the perfect solution! So what are you waiting for? Click \"Add to Cart\" above to get yours now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71I3uK4ENvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pop Your Dream","source_asin":"B08GX986HV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-635679","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GX986HV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GX986HV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":635680,"name":"Anagram Groom Airwalker Foil Balloon, 50\", Multicolored","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pbUdJiWEL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Accent your wedding themed party with this 50 inch large unique shape Groom air Walker foil Mylar balloon. The perfect balloon for your wedding party, this 50 inch Anagram party balloon is great for setting the scene! This balloon includes a Self-Sealing valve, preventing the gas from escaping after it's inflated. The balloon can be inflated with helium to float or with a balloon air inflator. Balloon arrives uninflated. Groom air Walker foil Mylar balloon 50\" by Anagram","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pbUdJiWEL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anagram","source_asin":"B076KJ8P7Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-635680","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076KJ8P7Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076KJ8P7Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":635681,"name":"Peer Hastam Mezuzah Scroll Ashkenaz Version from Israel, 100% Kosher with Certificate - Size 4.7\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Bbor-YZJL._AC_.jpg","description":"Each Parchment is hand written by an expert scribe on klaf shelil. Kosher and proofread by an expert proofreader. Comes with a computer check certificate from Mishmereth STaM, a certificate about the kosher level and a 4 years warranty. Made by \"Pe'er HaSTaM\" from Bnei-Brak Israel. Ashkenaz or Sefardi Scroll? There are two versions of mezuzah - Ashkenzai for Jews originating from Central and Eastern Europe or Sefardi for Middle Eastern (Arabic) and Persian background, whether or not they have any historical or ethnographic connection to the Iberian Peninsula. The difference between the two is the style of calligraphy. The ruling is that initially, everyone should follow his father's tradition but if for any reason, he has not done so, as long as the Mezuzah is kosher, he is observing the mitzvah.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Bbor-YZJL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Peer Hastam","source_asin":"B00WD9769E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-635681","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00WD9769E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00WD9769E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
