window.products.push({"id":635692,"name":"SICOHOME Baby's First Christmas Ornaments 2022, 3\" Baby 1st Christmas Ornament,Baby First Christmas Keepsake Gift for New Parents,Christmas Ornament 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Vcc6rEmUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Acrylic BABY'S FIRST CHRISTMAS ORNAMENT: 3\"Circular shaped hanging arcylic Christmas ornament. PERFECT FRIENDLY MATERIAL: Made of durable arcylic that can be stored for a long time to preserve their most precious memories for your baby. DOUBLE-SIDE PRINTED CHRISTMAS ORNAMENT: This double-side ornaments featured with \"Baby's First Christmas 2021\" make a great gifts to commemorate lifetime firsts and momentous occasions for your baby. GIFT BOX READY: Comes in a colorful and sturdy gift/storage box, so you can present this Christmas ornament to your loved ones or cherish it for years to come. Festive and collectible. PERFECT GIFTS: This beautiful ornament makes a great keepsake gift for babies & parents, The perfect keepsake for your first Christmas as a family of three.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Vcc6rEmUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SICOHOME","source_asin":"B07ZQBD14X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-635692","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZQBD14X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZQBD14X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":635693,"name":"Alice in Wonderland Artwork by Christian Jackson in Black Frame, 11 by 14-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":46.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sYY7yy17L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, matted framed art piece features the fairy tale, Alice in Wonderland. Christian Jackson is an interactive designer from Chicago, IL. He balances his digital life with reach, analog media. Jackson lives by that motto that you should only fill your life with things that are beautiful or useful. Since he is a designer with the heart of an artists, his work tends to do both. An 8x10 giclee print under acrylic in a 11x14 black frame. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating museum quality fine art reproductions. This high quality print is matted using antique white matting and comes in a dark wooden frame. A clear acrylic facing is added to protect the print. The piece is fully assembled by professional frames and comes ready to hang. The antique white mat allows the image to really stand out, making it a great addition to any space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sYY7yy17L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00D2NXQ0I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-635693","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00D2NXQ0I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00D2NXQ0I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
