window.products.push({"id":635762,"name":"Kowth Electric Lunch Box,110V&12V 40W Food Warmer,1.5L 2In1 Portable Self-Heating Luncheaze Box,With Removable Stainless Steel Container Spoon And For","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xOPQd06aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"2 in 1:Car and office Dual Use-- Came with 2 different power cables:12V cars/trucks use adapter and 110V home use plugs. With this Kowth electric lunch box warmer, you can heat your meal at school, in office, or during travel. Suitable for driver who has to drive on the road for a long time. Perfect for Uber driver and Delivery driver Food Grade Material-- The electric dual use food warmer is made of food grade PP plastic and 304 stainless steel container. It contains a soup box and can carry soup or jam. A spoon storage box at the top is easy to storage your dining tools. An extra stainless steel fork is provided. Solve the problem of forgetting to bring a spoon and fork High PTC Heating Technology-- PTC energy-saving constant temperature heating element to prevent overheating. Electric Lunch Box and use low-energy heating technology to keep the food at the right temperature and keep the food hydrated. The Portable Electric Lunch Box takes 20 to 30 minutes to heat the food (heating time depends on food temperature and room temperature). The power does not turn off automatically when heated. The indicator lights up when the lunch box is powered Multi-layer Separation and Portable Design-- The electric heating lunch box features a three-layer detachable design for easy dining and cleaning. The stainless steel container is convenient to wash, and a separation box inside the stainless steel liner, separate the rice and vegetables, soup, jam, etc. With a handle, it can be easily carried Size and Package Included-- Size: 23.5x11x17.5cm/9.3x4.3x6.9inch, Capacity: 1.5L .The package contains: 1* Electric Heating Lunch Box, 1* Spoon, 1* Fork, 1*Separator Box，2* Charging Cable","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xOPQd06aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kowth","source_asin":"B0828YFJPT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-635762","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0828YFJPT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0828YFJPT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
