window.products.push({"id":635765,"name":"Winemaker Series Wine Rack - 2 Column with Display Row - 6 Ft - Pine Dark Walnut Stain","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41+3Gq8Y-SL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Every wine bottle has a special spot in this two column individual bottle wine rack. This wine rack also has a built in display row that pops out due to it's short depth and is very attractive. Purchase two to stack on top of each other to maximize the height of your wine storage. All Winemaker wine racks must be mounted 1 1/2\" off the wall to ensure proper wine bottle stability, and will therefore add 1 /1/2\" to the listed dimensions. Moldings and platforms sold separately. Assembly required  Size: 3 Ft Height Rack : 35 15/16\" H x 9 11/16\" W x 8 3/4\" D= Total Storage Capacity of 18 Wine Bottles | 4 Ft Height Rack : 47 3/16\" H x 9 11/16\" W x 8 3/4\" D= Total Storage Capacity of 24 Wine Bottles | 6 Ft Height Rack : 72 9/16\" H x 9 11/16\" W x 8 3/4\" D= Total Storage Capacity of 34 Wine Bottles | 7 Ft Height Rack : 83 13/16\" H x 9 11/16\" W x 8 3/4\" D= Total Storage Capacity of 40 Wine Bottles | 8 Ft Height Rack : 95 1/16\" H x 9 11/16\" W x 8 3/4\" D= Total Storage Capacity of 46 Wine Bottles | 9 Ft Height Rack : 109 3/16\" H x 9 11/16\" W x 8 3/4\" D= Total Storage Capacity of 50 Wine Bottles Colors: Rustic Pine, Premium Redwood, Unstained, Classic Mahogany, Midnight Black, Light, Dark Walnut, Unstained. Available Woods: Rustic Pine - Our most affordable wood which is creamy in color with streaks and structurally sound knots. It's a softer wood but our best value by price per bottle . Premium Redwood - A modern favorite, Premium Redwood comes in a multitude of colors from white, pink, red, and reddish brown which look striking when put together in a full wine rack. It's sturdier than Pine and still a great value. It's a clear wood without knots and is admired for its resistance to shrinking, warping, and checking. This means that redwood wine cellars will age beautifully. It has a wide variety of grain patterns which get more pronounced with a stain applied.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41+3Gq8Y-SL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wine Cellar Innovations","source_asin":"B07192WCJ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-635765","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07192WCJ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07192WCJ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
