window.products.push({"id":635767,"name":"Vacuum Sealer Machine, SEATAO 90Kpa Food Vacuum Sealer Machine Preservation Dry & Moist & Extended Modes, Built-in Cutter & Bag Storage, Handle Locked","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":149.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DzBHCxaoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Fully automatic operation and easy locking handle】- 90Kpa high efficiency commercial vacuum sealer which can seal more than 200 times continuously in a short time. In the state of inserting the bag, only one step to select the sealing mode, 10-20 seconds to complete the sealing automatically. Seal a meal vacuum sealer machine has a patented handle system for easy locking of the lid. 【Multi-mode Settings 】- Sealing Choice (Dry/Moist/Extended) ,Vac & Seal& Cancel , Manual Seal, Container, Marinate, Pulse. Use Dry/Moist/Extended function mode to adapt to different food state on the vacuum preservation, to achieve the best preservation effect. Pulse mode-for fragile foods, you can stop the vacuum at any time depending on the condition of the food. This vacuum sealers with jar attachment external canister mode good for soup, salad,wine and so on. 【Double Heat Seal & 7X Longer Fresh Time】- This seal a meal vacuum sealer machine is double-heat seal provides added strength and security when sealing liquid-based or moist foods, air tight heat seal to keep food fresh up to 7 times longer. Well for prep-ahead meals, leftovers, and produce stored in the fridge to prevent freezer burn and food waste. Ensure fresh food preservation, reduce waste and meet the need to enjoy fresh and delicious food at any time. 【Built-in Cutter & Bag Storage 】- This food vacuum sealer machine has a complete starter kit with bag storage that can be easily adapted to any brand of vacuum sealer bags. Equipped with a bag cutter to accommodate custom bag linear cut sealing. 【What To Get & 5 Years Warranty】- This vacuum food machine comes with 1* Vacuum Sealer Machine , 1* Extra Foam Gasket , 1* External Vacuum Tube , 2* Vacuum Roll, 1* User Manual. And we offer the vacuum sealer 5 years warranty; if you have any problem, please give us a chance to help you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DzBHCxaoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEATAO","source_asin":"B0B3WR5R4D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-635767","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3WR5R4D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3WR5R4D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
