window.products.push({"id":635810,"name":"Christmas Cookie Stencil and Biscuit Cutter Set, 12-Pieces Stencils for Cookies Decorating Tools Royal Icing Templates, 7-Pieces Cookie Cutter Baking ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JG3DmBBtL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Package Includes: 7-Pieces Two-sided Biscuit Cutters, height is 2\"\", size(in diameter) is 3 7/8”, 3 7/16”, 3 1/16”, 2 5/8”, 2 1/4”, 1 7/8”, 1 1/2”. 12-Pieces Cookie Stencils, stencil size is 3 Inches high by 3 Inches wide. Technique: 1.Royal icing Place the stencil directly on the cake or onto rolled out modelling paste. Place dollops of royal icing to help the stencil in place, then spread the royal icing, using a scraper or pallet knife, evenly over the stencil. Gently pull off the stencil and admire. 2.Luster dusts Place on a cake that has been freshly covered with sugarpaste, roll over the stencil with a rolling pin, smear white vegetable fat over the exposed pattern, then using a soft brush, dust with lustre dust. 3.Chocolate Spread melted chocolate over the stencil onto a hard chocolate surface but make sure the chocolate you are spreading is not too hot otherwise it will melt your chocolate base. 4.Icing (powered) sugar / Cocoa Gently sprinkle through the stencil onto a cake top-but easy does it! The effect is awesome just with a light dusting and if you dust too much it will spread when someone as much as passea by! 5.Airbrushing Secure stencil in and spray-experiment using different colours on different sections of the stencil. Warm Tip: Wash the cookie stencils in warm water before use. Cookie stencils and biscuit cutters cannot be used in the oven. Note: There is 1-2cm(0.4-0.8inches)tolerance due to manual measurement. Due to the difference between different monitors, the picture may not reflect the actual color of the item.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JG3DmBBtL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"kowanii","source_asin":"B076YMYG23","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-635810","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076YMYG23","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076YMYG23","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
