window.products.push({"id":635950,"name":"Phnx Phyr Hand Blown Crystal Rose Gold Wine Glasses set 2 - Stem wine glass set - Long Stem wine glasses - Red wine glasses set of 2 - Large white win","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v-RGI71GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DESIGNED IN CANADA - from beautiful British Columbia, we present to you a wine glass worthy of it's kind. So unique and elegant...there is nothing on the market like it. From the shape to the design, we wanted to make sure anyone who holds one of our glasses can feel the time and countless hours spent on it for perfection. From us, to you. HAND BLOWN, CRYSTAL LEAD FREE GLASS - we made sure the quality of our glasses are at the highest level. Hand blown with precision and having the eye to catch any small creases: this will not do for us. One motion sculpting with no roll overs. Crystal clear and lead free, we stand behind our product. MAKES THE PERFECT GIFT - on top of the quality we bring to the table, our packaging to detail is for the surprise. Have your guests be wowed by the colors and impressed at first sight. As they open the box, what is left inside will be forever memorable. The experience is what we desire. ROSE GOLD RIM - a new technology on designer glassware and material which allows the rose gold metal coloring to stick by way of high temperature heat treatment. The final finish is more outstanding than the beginning phase as the dual process mixes color with metal adding a bright foil complexion. To preserve the color further, only hand wash with light soap and dry with a soft cloth towel. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE - are you not satisfied with our product? Simply contact us and we will make sure to get things right or your money back GUARANTEE. Your satisfaction means the world to us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v-RGI71GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Phnx Phyr","source_asin":"B08HSQWK3W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-635950","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HSQWK3W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HSQWK3W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
